Conflicts: tuned, tuned-ppd, power-profiles-daemon
Replaces: tuned, tuned-ppd, power-profiles-daemon
Description: Rust implementation of the TuneD system tuning daemon
 tuned-rs is a native Rust implementation of TuneD. It provides the standard
 tuned, tuned-adm, and tuned-ppd command and service identities, implements
 TuneD's system D-Bus API, and consumes existing TuneD profiles.
 .
 It also provides the power-profiles-daemon D-Bus interfaces used by desktop
 environments and includes a local web control center.
